</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Fuel Injection Volume</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Increase/decrease of fuel injection volume: with the injection volume at the start of the test as 0, it can be increased or decreased in 0.2% steps within the range of -12.5 to 24.6 %</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Test is stopped at 3000 r/min or more or under high temperature and high load</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Warm up the engine at 2500 r/min for approx. 90 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect [ECU Data Monitor] - [A/F Sensor Voltage B1S1] and [O2 Sensor Voltage B1S2] while the Active Test is being performed.</ptxt>
