<testgrp id="X39400000R702AC_14_0090" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FP300000">
<testtitle>Check Freeze Frame Data</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>Clearing the DTCs also clears the freeze frame data, so be sure to record it.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the customer problem analysis check sheet and freeze frame data to understand the vehicle conditions when the malfunction occurred.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Time-series freeze data allows the engine condition (ECU data) before and after DTC detection to be checked.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>From the freeze frame data, check whether the vehicle was idling (D position or P, N position) or driving (constant speed or accelerating/decelerating).</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>Check Item</title>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine Speed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>F/B status</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>O2 sensor voltage</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine load</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>F/B correction value</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Purge Rate</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Vehicle Speed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>F/B learning value</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ECT Shift Position</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Intake Air Volume</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A/F sensor voltage</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Engine Coolant Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
