<testgrp id="X39400000R702AC_14_0091" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FP400000">
<scantool type="8"/>
<testtitle>Check Problem Symptom</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>When confirming the vehicle problem symptom under the malfunction condition, use the following method.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the EFI MAIN fuse (20A), wait 60 seconds or more, then reinstall the fuse.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Clear the F/B learning value of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, switch from normal mode to check mode.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>To reproduce check engine light illumination, use check mode (increased detection sensitivity mode) of SST (TaSCAN); the malfunction can be detected in 1 trip.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, select [Active Test] - [Fuel Injection Volume].</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>System selection screen: Powertrain → TCCS → Active Test</title>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Restrictions</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Fuel Injection Volume</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Increase/decrease of fuel injection volume: with the injection volume at the start of the test as 0, it can be increased or decreased in 0.2% steps within the range of -12.5 to 24.6 %</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Test is stopped at 3000 r/min or more or under high temperature and high load</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Move the injection volume 1 steps toward the increase or decrease side.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>This operation suspends F/B correction and F/B learning, making the problem symptom easier to confirm.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Start the engine.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Referring to the driving conditions in the freeze frame data, reproduce the conditions when the malfunction occurred and confirm the problem symptom.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.64in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.49in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Problem symptom cannot be confirmed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Problem symptom can be confirmed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000R702AC_14_0092" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000R702AC_14_0095" fin="false">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000R702AC_14_0092" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FP500000">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (F/B Correction Value and F/B Learned Value)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
