</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display, inspect [ECU Data Monitor] - [F/B Correction Value Bank 1] and [F/B Learning Value Bank 1].</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Standard</title>
