<testgrp id="X39400000R702AC_14_0093" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FP600000">
<testtitle>System Normal</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the customer problem analysis check sheet and freeze frame data again, and if there is no abnormality, end the procedure.</ptxt>
</test1>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the vehicle runs out of fuel, the fuel correction amount becomes +35% or more, and if this continues (2 trips), lean malfunction P0171/25 may be output.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Repeated short trips (short driving time (distance) from IG ON to OFF) may cause gasoline to evaporate during subsequent engine warm-up, and the increased blow-by gas may cause P0172/25 to be output.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
